trumpet intro... [Fm]..[A#]..[G#]..[Cm]

(4 times).

[Cm]bangle ke peeche hai taala, ghusu kaha se main saala..laila ki khidki khuli hai, khidki ke neeche hai naala..

[A#]khidki pe koi khada hai, laila ka taanka bhida hai..maje udati hai meri mohabbat ki

[G#]booch maar [Cm]ke

{c: Chorus}(2 times)

Oo meri [Fm]jaan..Oo meri [A#]jaan

mere ko [G#]majnu bana [Cm]kar

kaha chal [Fm]di.. kaha chal [A#]di

pyaar ki [G#]pungi baja [Cm]kar

rest of the song is same.
